&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img height=&quot;26px&quot; src=&quot;//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/shortcut-trick-image.png&quot; width=&quot;26px&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Shortcut Trick&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The ratio of amount&amp;nbsp;and principal for 2 years if the sum is compounded annually =&amp;nbsp;&amp;radic;A&amp;nbsp;∶&amp;nbsp;&amp;radic;P&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr;&amp;nbsp;&amp;radic;841&amp;nbsp;∶&amp;nbsp;&amp;radic;625&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; 29&amp;nbsp;∶ 25&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Rate of interest = [(29&amp;nbsp;- 25)/25]&amp;nbsp;&amp;times; 100&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; Rate of interest = (4/25)&amp;nbsp;&amp;times; 100&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; Rate of interest = 4 &amp;times; 4 = 16&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;&amp;there4; Rate of the interest is 16%.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Traditional method:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Given:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Time = 2 years&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The sum becomes 841/625 itself.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Formula used:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A = P(1 + r/100)&lt;span style=&quot;position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Where, A = Amount, P = Principal, r = Rate of interest, n = Time in years&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;Calculation:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Let the principal be P.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Amount will become 841/625 in 2 years&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;841/625 = (1 + r/100)&lt;span style=&quot;position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; 841/625 = (1 + r/100)&lt;span style=&quot;position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; (29/25)&lt;span style=&quot;position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;= (1 + r/100)&lt;span style=&quot;position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; 26/25 = 1 + r/100&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; r/100 = 29/25 - 1&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; r/100 = 4/25&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; r = 16%&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;&amp;there4;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;The rate of interest is 16%.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

