&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Given:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Monthly income ratio of Ramu and Somu = 6 : 5&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Ration of their expenditure = 7 : 6&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Savings of Ramu and Somu = 1500 and 1000&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Concept used:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Monthly income - expenditure = Savings&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Calculation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Let Ramu&amp;#39;s monthly income = 6a&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; Somu monthly income = 5a&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;According to question,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;math-tex&quot;&gt;\(6a - 1500 \over 5a - 1000\)&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;=&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;math-tex&quot;&gt;\(7 \over 6\)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;math-tex&quot;&gt;\(36a - 9000 = 35a - 7000\)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;rArr; a = 2000&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Monthly income of Ramu = 6a&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; 6 x 2000 = Rs.12000&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

