&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-5ac6ccc2-7fff-4e5a-d509-9b71f4601d18&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;  font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;दिया है&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

