en.value:
&lt;p&gt;The correct answer is&lt;strong&gt; &amp;quot;Nauseous&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img height=&quot;26px&quot; src=&quot;//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png&quot; width=&quot;26px&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Key Points&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;The correctly spelt word is &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;Nauseous&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nauseous is an adjective that means feeling sick to the stomach or causing such a feeling&lt;/strong&gt;.
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Example:&lt;/em&gt; &amp;quot;After eating too much junk food, she felt nauseous and had to lie down.&amp;quot;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Thus, the correct spelling is &lt;strong&gt;&amp;quot;Nauseous&amp;quot;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Correct: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/u&gt;Nauseous&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Calculation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Let the slower pipe fill the tank in x&amp;nbsp;minutes.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Then, the faster pipe can fill the same tank in (x/3) minutes.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;When both pipes are used together, they can fill the tank in 36 minutes. So their combined rate of filling the tank is = 1/36 tank per minute&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The slower pipe fills the tank at a rate of 1/x tank per minute.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The faster pipe fills the tank at a rate of 1/(x/3) = 3/x tank per minute.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; 1/x + 3/x = 1/36&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;rArr;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;4/x = 1/36&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;rArr;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;36 &amp;times; 4 = x&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So, x = 144.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Therefore, the slower pipe alone can fill the tank in 144 minutes.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

hn.value:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;गणना:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;माना धीमी&amp;nbsp;गति वाला&amp;nbsp;पाइप &lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;टैंक&lt;/span&gt; को x मिनट में भरता है।&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;तो, तेज&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;गति वाला&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;पाइप उसी टैंक को (x/3) मिनट में भर सकता है।&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;जब दोनों पाइपों का एक साथ उपयोग किया जाता है, तो वे टैंक को 36 मिनट में भर सकते हैं। इसलिए&amp;nbsp;टैंक को&amp;nbsp;भरने की उनकी संयुक्त दर है = 1/36 टैंक प्रति मिनट&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;धीमी&lt;/span&gt; गति वाला&amp;nbsp;पाइप टैंक को 1/x टैंक प्रति मिनट की दर से भरता है।&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;तेज&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;गति वाला&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;पाइप टैंक को 1/(x/3) की दर से भरता है =3/x टैंक प्रति मिन&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; 1/x + 3/x = 1/36&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;rArr;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;4/x = 1/36&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;rArr;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;36 &amp;times; 4 = x&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;इसलिए, x = 144&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;अतः&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;धीमी&amp;nbsp;गति वाला&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;पाइप&amp;nbsp;टैंक को अकेले&amp;nbsp;144 मिनट में भर सकता है।&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

en.value:
&lt;p data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;color:  (33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Calculation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;color:  (33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;&quot;&gt;We can calculate the number taken to complete the work using the formula&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;color:  (33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;&quot;&gt;Days = y(x + n)/(x + y)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;color:  (33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;&quot;&gt;Where x and y are the number of days taken by A and B.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;color:  (33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;&quot;&gt;And n is the number of days before A left&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;color:  (33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;&quot;&gt;Here we have x = 8, y = 24&amp;nbsp;and n = 4&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;color:  (33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;&quot;&gt;Hence, days required = 24&amp;nbsp;&amp;times; (8&amp;nbsp;+ 4)/(8&amp;nbsp;+ 24)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;color:  (33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;&quot;&gt;= 24&amp;nbsp;&amp;times; 12/32&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;color:  (33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;&quot;&gt;= 9 days&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p data-darkreader-inline-color=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;color:  (33, 37, 41); --darkreader-inline-color: #d1cdc7;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; &quot;&gt;&amp;there4;&lt;/span&gt; Option 3 is the correct answer.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

hn.value:
&lt;p style=&quot;color:  (33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;गणना:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;color:  (33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;हम निम्नलिखित&amp;nbsp;सूत्र का उपयोग करके कार्य को पूरा करने में लगने वाले समय की गणना कर सकते हैं:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;color:  (33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;दिन&amp;nbsp;= y(x + n)/(x + y)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;जहाँ x और y, A और B द्वारा लिए गए दिनों की संख्या है।&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;और n, A के छोड़ने से पहले के दिनों की संख्या है।&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;यहाँ, हमारे पास x = 8, y = 24 और n = 4 है।&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;color:  (33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;अतः, अभीष्ट दिनों की संख्या&amp;nbsp;= 24&amp;nbsp;&amp;times; (8&amp;nbsp;+ 4)/(8&amp;nbsp;+ 24)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;color:  (33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;= 24&amp;nbsp;&amp;times; 12/32&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;color:  (33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;= 9 दिन&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;color:  (33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; &quot;&gt;&amp;there4;&lt;/span&gt; विकल्प 3 सही उत्तर है।&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

en.value:
&lt;p&gt;The correct answer is&lt;strong&gt; &amp;#39;few&amp;#39;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img height=&quot;26px&quot; src=&quot;//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png&quot; width=&quot;26px&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Key Points&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;#39;Few&amp;#39; &lt;/strong&gt;is a quantifier. When it used without the articles &amp;#39;a/the&amp;#39;, &amp;#39;&lt;strong&gt;few&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;#39; represents &lt;strong&gt;&amp;#39;hardly any/ none&amp;#39;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;#39;A&amp;nbsp;few&amp;#39;&lt;/strong&gt; means &lt;strong&gt;&amp;#39;some but not many&amp;#39;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;#39;The few&amp;#39;&lt;/strong&gt; means&lt;strong&gt; &amp;#39;not many but all available&amp;#39;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The given sentence implies that no one attended the seminar so the seminar had to be postponed.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Therefore, &amp;#39;&lt;strong&gt;few&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;#39; is the correct alternative to fill in the blank.&lt;br /&gt;
	&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complete Sentence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;The seminar was postponed as &lt;strong&gt;few&lt;/strong&gt; people turned up to attend it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/01/hin1.png&quot; style=&quot;width: 200px; height: 92px;&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&amp;#39;&lt;strong&gt;Few&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;#39; एक &lt;strong&gt;quantifier&lt;/strong&gt; है। जब यह &lt;strong&gt;article&amp;nbsp;&amp;#39;a&amp;nbsp;/ the&amp;#39;&lt;/strong&gt; के ​​बिना उपयोग किया जाता है, तो &lt;strong&gt;&amp;#39;few&amp;#39; &amp;#39;hardly any/ none&amp;#39;&lt;/strong&gt; का प्रतिनिधित्व करता है।&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;#39;A few&amp;#39;&lt;/strong&gt; का अर्थ है &lt;strong&gt;&amp;#39;some but not many&amp;rsquo;&lt;/strong&gt;।&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;#39;The few&amp;#39;&lt;/strong&gt; का अर्थ है &lt;strong&gt;&amp;#39;not many but all available&amp;#39;&lt;/strong&gt;।&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;दिए गए वाक्य का अर्थ है कि कोई भी सेमिनार में शामिल नहीं हुआ था इसलिए सेमिनार को स्थगित करना पड़ा।&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;इसलिए, &lt;strong&gt;&amp;#39;few&amp;#39; blank &lt;/strong&gt;के लिए&amp;nbsp;सही विकल्प है।&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The most appropriate option to fill in the blank is:&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;thoughtfully&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img height=&quot;26px&quot; src=&quot;//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png&quot; width=&quot;26px&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Key Points&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The completed sentence would be: &lt;strong&gt;Sonu acted thoughtfully.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Option 2) &amp;quot;thoughtfully&amp;quot; provides the best fit in terms of maintaining the coherence and meaning of the sentence. It describes how Sonu acted, indicating that he acted in a considerate, deliberate, or reflective manner.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Options 1) &amp;quot;with thought,&amp;quot; 3) &amp;quot;thoughtless,&amp;quot; and 4) &amp;quot;thoughtful&amp;quot; do not accurately convey the intended meaning.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Option 1) is a phrase that does not properly modify the verb &amp;quot;acted,&amp;quot; while options 3) and 4) convey different meanings related to lacking thought or being considerate.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Therefore, option 2) &amp;quot;&lt;strong&gt;thoughtfully&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;quot; is the most appropriate choice to fill in the blank.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;The correct answer is &lt;strong&gt;&amp;#39;beggars&amp;#39;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img height=&quot;26px&quot; src=&quot;//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png&quot; width=&quot;26px&quot; /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Key Points&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;The idiom &amp;quot;If wishes were horses, then beggars would ride&amp;quot; means that if we could fulfill all our wishes just by wishing, even the most destitute people (beggars) would have everything they desire.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;The idiom expresses the idea that wishes alone are not enough to bring about desired outcomes; tangible effort or action is required.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;The phrase is often used to convey the notion that simply wishing for something does not make it a reality.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;The choice of &amp;#39;beggars&amp;#39; in the idiom is used to emphasize the unlikely or impossible nature of the wish fulfillment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Therefore, the correct answer is Option 1.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Given&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Expression to evaluate =&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;math-tex&quot;&gt;\(\rm \left[ {1 \over 4} \ of\ 18 \div{6 \over 5} + \left({1 \over 8} + {7 \over 4}\right)\right] × {1 \over 15}\)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bolder;&quot;&gt;Concept used:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/08/image%20%282%29.png&quot; style=&quot;width: 350px; height: 196px;&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;math-tex&quot;&gt;\(\rm \left[ {1 \over 4} \ of\ 18 \div{6 \over 5} + \left({1 \over 8} + {7 \over 4}\right)\right] × {1 \over 15}\)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;rArr; [(18/4)&amp;nbsp;&amp;times; (5/6) + (15/8)]&amp;nbsp;&amp;times; (1/15)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;&amp;rArr; [15/4 + 15/8&amp;nbsp;]&amp;nbsp;&amp;times;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;math-tex&quot;&gt;\(\frac{1}{15}\)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;&amp;rArr; 15&amp;nbsp;&amp;times; 3/8&amp;nbsp;&amp;times;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;math-tex&quot;&gt;\(\frac{1}{15}\)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41);&quot;&gt;&amp;rArr; 3/8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Therefore, the value of the given expression is 3/8.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

