	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Hence, we can infer that the antonym of &lt;strong&gt;&amp;#39;perseverance&amp;#39;&lt;/strong&gt; is &lt;strong&gt;&amp;#39;doubt&amp;#39;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
